11. Recent (within 90 days prior to procedure) stroke, transient ischemic attack, or myocardial infarction;
12. New York Heart Association Class IV;
13. Patients with severe renal failure (estimated glomerular filtration rate\ 70% diameter stenosis OR symptomatic carotid disease (\>50% diameter stenosis with ipsilateral stroke or TIA). Subjects with prior carotid endarterectomy or carotid stent placement may be enrolled, provided that known diameter stenosis is \<50%;
15. Life expectancy is less than 1 year;
16. Current participation in another investigational drug or device study.

Inclusion Criteria:

