Biochemical tests:

Serum albumin (ALB) ≥30 g/L; Alanine aminotransferase (ALT) and aspartate aminotransferase (AST) \ 450 ms for males, \>470 ms for females, QTcF interval calculated by Fridericia formula), symptomatic congestive heart failure;
